Thank you to everyone who submitted theories for the Death Trick: Double Blind Demo Theories  Competition, we loved reading through all the entries, and have selected our 3 winners! 

The winner of the funniest entry goes to Discord member; 
Blooper Dooper with their tale of the Hattie Mice Mech Fusion.

The winner of the most well developed theory goes to Discord member; 
Neon Sparky Dragon Force and their incredibly well researched and crafted theory!

Theory we most want to be true goes to Discord member; 
coco and their theory that Thief the Cat murdered Hattie... 

